"A family stone is an Artonan household's hearth stone, akin to the hearthstones visitors bleed on."
"On moving day it is hauled to the new house; a family is settled once its stone is placed."
"Superstitious families will not let outsiders carry it, lest alien blood or magic misalign it."
"Honored heirlooms such as a gifted bound wand may be set above it."
